# Articles Reference Content

When to reach for the definite article, and every form it takes.

## Purpose

Teach deployment, not formation. The six-slot paradigm is a lookup; the error learners actually make is omitting an article Greek requires, or supplying one it refuses.

## Key Insight

Forming the article is a lookup. Knowing when to use it is the skill. Greek puts an article in front of countries, abstract nouns, whole categories and possessives, where English refuses one.

Gender detection lives on the Nouns tab — the ending tells you the gender, the gender picks the column here.

