## Every Form, and How It's Spelled (Lookup band)

<paradigm name="article-paradigm" component="ArticleParadigm">
Rendered by the shared `ArticleParadigm` in `components/case-table.tsx` (the Cases tab uses the same component). Case colour on row headers, gender colour on column chips, cells neutral. Band lede points to Prepositions for the σε fusions (στο, στη, στον).

### Singular

|      | Masculine | Feminine | Neuter |
|------|-----------|----------|--------|
| Nom  | ο         | η        | το     |
| Acc  | τον       | τη(ν)    | το     |
| Gen  | του       | της      | του    |

### Plural

|      | Masculine | Feminine | Neuter |
|------|-----------|----------|--------|
| Nom  | οι        | οι       | τα     |
| Acc  | τους      | τις      | τα     |
| Gen  | των       | των      | των    |

</paradigm>

