## Data Source

Static content from:
- `@/constants/agreement` (ARTICLE_AGREEMENT_QUICK_REF)
- `@/constants/homographs` (HOMOGRAPH_ROWS - shared with the Pronouns tab)
- `articles-section.tsx` locals: GREEK_ADDS (the "Greek adds it" LookupCard rows) and NU_RULE_COLUMNS (the movable-ν examples). The single "Greek drops it" row (είναι γιατρός) is inline JSX.
- The article paradigm is the shared `ArticleParadigm` from `components/case-table.tsx`; the homograph table is `HomographCallout` from `components/homograph-callout.tsx`.

Gender hints are NOT here — they live in `nouns-section.tsx` (GENDER_HINTS).

